🩺 <b>Probes for tunnel corp-a</b>

A probe runs inside the tunnel namespace and answers whether traffic is flowing right now. Without probes, health is unknown, which is more accurate than claiming it works.

• TCP: not set
• HTTPS: <code>https://intranet.corp.internal/health</code>
• DNS: not set

